little difference between the builtin IOASIC SCSI and PMAZB-A sat on
12.5MHz TC slot, so it's imprecative.

Technically, it'd be possible to expect performance boost with KZTSA-A
i960 equipped single channel differential SCSI TC card, however,
NetBSD does not have any support for it this moment.

