Yes with 1.5-current it has support for console and X

for console use 'wscons' option for the config file.
for X use xsrc.tar.gz from current.

Btw, it take 6 hours for a full build on a 3000/300L 32Mo.

You can change the xc/conf/cf/site.df to use -O option to get
smaller binary. Don't use -Os it give unstable binary (don't know why).
